{"seq":1,"slug":"bonded-ledger-count-audit","title":"保税维修账册盘点与海关核查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/repair-supervision-ops/bonded-ledger-count-audit","wordCount":1898,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"保税维修账册盘点与海关核查\">保税维修账册盘点与海关核查</h1><p>盘点是保税维修运营里最不被重视、却最能暴露问题的一件事。它看起来只是每年数一次库房，实际上是把<strong>仓库实物、工单记录、账册底账</strong>三方对平的强制动作。监管规则说得直接：海关对区内企业实行<strong>稽查、核查制度</strong>，企业应当配合，如实提供相关账簿、单证等有关资料及电子数据（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2022-03/30/content_5682479.htm\">《中华人民共和国海关综合保税区管理办法》第三十六条</a>）；保税维修专用账册<strong>原则上每年至少盘点一次</strong>，并须如实申报替换下的旧件、坏件信息与保税边角料信息（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2018-12/31/content_5447554.htm\">海关总署公告2018年第203号</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>盘点的产出不是一份数字，而是一份<strong>差异清单加归因</strong>。三点核对的三方各有各的偏差来源：仓库实物会因错放、丢失、未登记而偏离；工单记录会因漏记领料、未及时关闭、退料未登记而偏离；账册底账会因申报滞后、科目错挂而偏离。三方全部相同才是正常状态，而当它们不一致时，<strong>关键是能说出差异落在哪一段流程上</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[仓库实物] --&gt; D{三点核对}&#10;  B[工单记录] --&gt; D&#10;  C[账册底账] --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt;|三方一致| E[盘点通过]&#10;  D --&gt;|不一致| F[差异归因]&#10;  F --&gt; G[收货环节漏记?]&#10;  F --&gt; H[耗用环节错扣?]&#10;  F --&gt; I[处置环节漏申报?]&#10;  F --&gt; J[错放/丢失?]&#10;  G --&gt; K[补登记/更正]&#10;  H --&gt; K&#10;  I --&gt; K&#10;  J --&gt; L[责任追查 + 处置]&#10;  K --&gt; M[调整留痕&lt;br/&gt;经审批]&#10;  L --&gt; M\">graph TD\n  A[仓库实物] --&gt; D{三点核对}\n  B[工单记录] --&gt; D\n  C[账册底账] --&gt; D\n  D --&gt;|三方一致| E[盘点通过]\n  D --&gt;|不一致| F[差异归因]\n  F --&gt; G[收货环节漏记?]\n  F --&gt; H[耗用环节错扣?]\n  F --&gt; I[处置环节漏申报?]\n  F --&gt; J[错放/丢失?]\n  G --&gt; K[补登记/更正]\n  H --&gt; K\n  I --&gt; K\n  J --&gt; L[责任追查 + 处置]\n  K --&gt; M[调整留痕&lt;br/&gt;经审批]\n  L --&gt; M</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>常见成因</th>\n<th>归因动作</th>\n<th>更正方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实物少、账册有</td>\n<td>错放、丢失、未登记出库</td>\n<td>全库位搜索 + 出区记录核对</td>\n<td>补出区单或报损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实物多、账册无</td>\n<td>进境未挂账、退料未回写</td>\n<td>进境申报与退料单回溯</td>\n<td>补挂账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账实相符但科目错</td>\n<td>保税/非保税错扣</td>\n<td>领料记录与料号属性核对</td>\n<td>科目调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副产物无凭证</td>\n<td>旧件未登记、处置漏报</td>\n<td>工单替换件清单比对</td>\n<td>补登记与处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在修货物长期挂账</td>\n<td>工单未关闭</td>\n<td>工单时长监控</td>\n<td>关闭或拆分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"盘点的法定要求\">盘点的法定要求</h2><h3 id=\"频次与内容\">频次与内容</h3><p>规则要求每年至少盘点一次，这是底线而非常态频率。对业务量大的维修中心，年度盘点不足以支撑日常管理——一台设备在两次盘点之间可能已经消失半年。因此实务上会做<strong>分层盘点</strong>：日常的循环盘点（按货位轮盘）、月度的科目盘点、以及年度的全面盘点。法定要求满足的是最后一种，而前两种是为了让年度盘点不出现难以归因的大额差异。</p>\n<p>盘点的内容有两项容易被忽略。第一项是<strong>替换下的旧件坏件信息</strong>：品名、规格型号、数量都要申报。第二项是<strong>保税边角料信息</strong>，仅在使用保税料件时需要。这两项都与第 2 章的处置科目对应——盘点时若发现处置科目的记录与实物不符，说明处置流程有漏报。</p>\n<h3 id=\"盘点与核销的关系\">盘点与核销的关系</h3><p>盘点与核销是彼此补充的两种对账。核销是<strong>账面内部的平衡</strong>（期初 = 耗用 + 结转 + 剩余 + 差异），盘点是把账面数字<strong>与实物挂钩</strong>。只做核销不做盘点，账面可以自洽而与现实脱节；只做盘点不做核销，则没有法定的清账动作。因此年度节奏通常是：周期末先做盘点取得实物数据，再以盘点结果修正核销差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异归因的顺序\">差异归因的顺序</h2><h3 id=\"按流程顺序排查\">按流程顺序排查</h3><p>差异归因最忌无序列举所有可能原因。有效的做法是<strong>按业务流程顺序排查</strong>，因为上游的错漏会伪装成下游的差异。一台机器实物少、账册有，可能是丢失，也可能是三个月前就已经出境但出区单未回写——后者属于处置环节漏申报，而上游排查会发现它其实从未&quot;丢&quot;过。</p>\n<p>排查顺序应当是：进境挂账 → 领料扣减 → 完工转移 → 副产物登记 → 复出境/处置。每一段的核对用不同的键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 差异归因：逐段核对，命中即停&#10;WITH seg1 AS (   -- 进境挂账缺失&#10;  SELECT d.decl_id, unnest(d.serial_nos) AS serial_no&#10;  FROM repair_entry_declaration d&#10;  LEFT JOIN repair_ledger_item i ON i.item_id = d.ledger_item_id&#10;  WHERE i.item_id IS NULL&#10;),&#10;seg2 AS (        -- 工单未关闭且超期&#10;  SELECT wo_id, serial_no FROM repair_work_order&#10;  WHERE status &lt;&gt; &#39;CLOSED&#39; AND completed_at IS NULL&#10;    AND opened_at &lt; now() - interval &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;),&#10;seg3 AS (        -- 副产物无处置凭证&#10;  SELECT bp_id, serial_no FROM repair_byproduct bp&#10;  WHERE NOT EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM byproduct_disposal d WHERE d.bp_id = bp.bp_id)&#10;),&#10;seg4 AS (        -- 已修复未出境&#10;  SELECT wo_id, serial_no FROM repair_work_order&#10;  WHERE conclusion = &#39;FIXED&#39; AND completed_at &lt; now() - interval &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;    AND NOT EXISTS (&#10;      SELECT 1 FROM repair_reexport_declaration r&#10;      WHERE serial_no = ANY(r.serial_nos))&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#39;ENTRY_NOT_BOOKED&#39;   AS cause, serial_no FROM seg1&#10;UNION ALL SELECT &#39;WORK_ORDER_STALE&#39;, serial_no FROM seg2&#10;UNION ALL SELECT &#39;BYPRODUCT_NO_VOUCHER&#39;, serial_no FROM seg3&#10;UNION ALL SELECT &#39;FIXED_NOT_SHIPPED&#39;, serial_no FROM seg4;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 差异归因：逐段核对，命中即停</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seg1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 进境挂账缺失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, unnest(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">serial_nos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> serial_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_entry_declaration d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_ledger_item i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ledger_item_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">seg2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 工单未关闭且超期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wo_id, serial_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_work_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CLOSED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> completed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opened_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">seg3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 副产物无处置凭证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bp_id, serial_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_byproduct bp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> byproduct_disposal d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bp_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bp_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">seg4 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 已修复未出境</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wo_id, serial_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_work_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conclusion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FIXED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> completed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_reexport_declaration r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> serial_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ANY(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">serial_nos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ENTRY_NOT_BOOKED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cause, serial_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seg1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNION ALL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'WORK_ORDER_STALE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, serial_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seg2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNION ALL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'BYPRODUCT_NO_VOUCHER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, serial_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seg3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNION ALL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FIXED_NOT_SHIPPED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, serial_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seg4;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段查询的价值在于它把&quot;归因&quot;从一次人工分析变成一次例行检测——同一段 SQL 可以每天跑，输出即是待处理清单，而不是等到年度盘点时才发现积压。</p>\n<h3 id=\"差异的容忍与报告\">差异的容忍与报告</h3><p>差异不可能长期为零。真正要管理的是差异的<strong>结构</strong>：金额小、数量多、集中在某一流程段的，通常是流程缺陷，改流程即可；金额大、数量少、分散的，通常是个案，需要逐笔追查。把这两个维度做成分类统计，比单一的差异率数字更有诊断力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;count_variance_report&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;count_id&quot;: &quot;CNT-2026-Q3&quot;,&#10;    &quot;book_id&quot;: &quot;LB-2026-0017&quot;,&#10;    &quot;items_checked&quot;: 12480,&#10;    &quot;variance_units&quot;: 37,&#10;    &quot;variance_value&quot;: 186000.0,&#10;    &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;CNY&quot;,&#10;    &quot;by_cause&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;WORK_ORDER_STALE&quot;: { &quot;units&quot;: 21, &quot;value&quot;: 92000.0 },&#10;      &quot;BYPRODUCT_NO_VOUCHER&quot;: { &quot;units&quot;: 12, &quot;value&quot;: 14000.0 },&#10;      &quot;FIXED_NOT_SHIPPED&quot;: { &quot;units&quot;: 3, &quot;value&quot;: 74000.0 },&#10;      &quot;UNEXPLAINED&quot;: { &quot;units&quot;: 1, &quot;value&quot;: 6000.0 }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;unexplained_ratio&quot;: 0.032,&#10;    &quot;action_plan&quot;: [&#10;      &quot;WORK_ORDER_STALE: 收紧工单时长阈值至 60 天并周报&quot;,&#10;      &quot;FIXED_NOT_SHIPPED: 逐台核对物流状态&quot;,&#10;      &quot;UNEXPLAINED: 立案追查&quot;&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"count_variance_report\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"count_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CNT-2026-Q3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"book_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LB-2026-0017\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"items_checked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12480</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"variance_units\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">37</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"variance_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">186000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CNY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"by_cause\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"WORK_ORDER_STALE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"units\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">21</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">92000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"BYPRODUCT_NO_VOUCHER\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"units\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"FIXED_NOT_SHIPPED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"units\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">74000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"UNEXPLAINED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"units\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"unexplained_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.032</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"action_plan\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"WORK_ORDER_STALE: 收紧工单时长阈值至 60 天并周报\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"FIXED_NOT_SHIPPED: 逐台核对物流状态\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"UNEXPLAINED: 立案追查\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>unexplained_ratio</code> 是这份报告里最该盯的数字。有成因的差异是管理问题，无成因的差异才是风险——它意味着账册存在无法解释的缺口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核查触发与整改\">核查触发与整改</h2><h3 id=\"触发整改的情形\">触发整改的情形</h3><p>监管规则把整改情形与后果写得很具体。需要整改的包括：不再符合准入条件、未按规定处置相关货物料件或废弃物、违反固体废物管理规定擅自处置固体废弃物。后果有两项：<strong>整改期间不受理新设专用电子化账册</strong>，原电子账册<strong>自本核销周期截止日起暂停</strong>。海关也可以主动要求整改。</p>\n<p>还有一条更尖锐的规定：企业涉嫌走私被立案调查的，海关不受理其新设保税维修专用电子化账（手）册。它比整改更前置——立案即冻结增量业务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"终止业务的四类情形\">终止业务的四类情形</h3><p>规则列出了终止业务的情形，值得逐条对照业务风险：企业倒闭破产或被撤销经营资格；信用被降为失信企业；<strong>保税维修货物在境内被转让或移作他用</strong>；整改期满仍不能按海关要求管理货物。四类中第一类是外部事实，第二、四类是管理能力问题，而第三类是企业自身流程设计可以直接预防的——它是下一篇 <a href=\"no-domestic-sale-compliance\">维修货物不得境内销售合规管控</a> 的主题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>终止情形</th>\n<th>可预防性</th>\n<th>预防手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>倒闭/被撤销资格</td>\n<td>不可预防</td>\n<td>风险准备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信用降为失信</td>\n<td>部分可预防</td>\n<td>合规体系、差异率控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货物境内被转让或移作他用</td>\n<td><strong>高</strong></td>\n<td>序列号追踪 + 出区校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整改期满仍不达标</td>\n<td>部分可预防</td>\n<td>整改项目管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>盘点的产出是差异清单加归因，而非一份数字；三点核对的对象是仓库实物、工单记录、账册底账。</li>\n<li>法定要求是每年至少盘点一次，并申报替换旧件坏件与保税边角料信息；实务上应以分层盘点支撑，避免年度差异无法归因。</li>\n<li>差异归因应按业务流程顺序排查（进境→领料→完工→副产物→处置），因为上游错漏会伪装成下游差异；这段检测应做成例行任务而非年度一次。</li>\n<li>差异管理看结构而非单一数字：有成因的差异是管理问题，<code>unexplained_ratio</code> 才是风险指标。</li>\n<li>整改后果是双重的——不受理新账册、原账册在周期截止日起暂停；终止业务的四类情形中，&quot;境内转让或移作他用&quot;是企业流程可直接预防的一类。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"no-domestic-sale-compliance\">维修货物不得境内销售合规管控</a> 会把这条最可预防的红线拆成可检测的行为模式与工程实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"保税维修账册盘点与海关核查","id":"保税维修账册盘点与海关核查"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"盘点的法定要求","id":"盘点的法定要求"},{"level":3,"text":"频次与内容","id":"频次与内容"},{"level":3,"text":"盘点与核销的关系","id":"盘点与核销的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"差异归因的顺序","id":"差异归因的顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"按流程顺序排查","id":"按流程顺序排查"},{"level":3,"text":"差异的容忍与报告","id":"差异的容忍与报告"},{"level":2,"text":"核查触发与整改","id":"核查触发与整改"},{"level":3,"text":"触发整改的情形","id":"触发整改的情形"},{"level":3,"text":"终止业务的四类情形","id":"终止业务的四类情形"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"保税维修关税/增值税待遇与内销红线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/entry-reexport-writeoff/bonded-repair-tax-treatment"},"next":{"title":"维修货物不得境内销售合规管控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/repair-supervision-ops/no-domestic-sale-compliance"}}